---
title: Thinking
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: Thinking | Parul Soni Manvati
seoDescription: "Notes on transformation, organisations and building what comes next: how organisations change, how technology alters operating models, how businesses scale, and what happens when markets move faster than the systems around them."
---
{% import "partials/cta.njk" as cta %}

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Thinking</span>
    <h1>Notes on transformation, organisations and building what comes next.</h1>
    <p>I write about problems I encounter repeatedly: how organisations change, how technology alters operating models, how businesses scale, and what happens when markets move faster than the systems around them.</p>
    <div class="hero__ctas" style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Start a Conversation →</a>
      {{ cta.linkedinLink() }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="flywheel-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading" style="text-align: center; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      <h2>How my thinking evolves</h2>
      <p style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Most of my ideas start in the work itself.</p>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/flywheel.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tier-secondary">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">Territories</span>
      <h2>What I keep coming back to</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for t in thinkingTerritories %}
      <a class="accent-card accent-card--{{ t.accent }}" href="/thinking/?territory={{ t.slug }}">
        <span class="accent-card__label">{{ t.title }}</span>
        <p>{{ t.description }}</p>
        {% if t.question %}<p class="accent-card__question">{{ t.question }}</p>{% endif %}
        <span class="accent-card__link">Explore →</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set featuredArticles = collections.articles | featured %}
{% set moreArticles = collections.articles | notFeatured %}

{% if collections.activeThinkingTerritories.length %}
<section class="capability-filter-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="capability-filter__intro-label">Filter by territory</span>
    <div class="capability-filter" data-thinking-filter-bar>
      <button type="button" class="is-active" data-territory-filter="all">All</button>
      {% for t in collections.activeThinkingTerritories %}
      <button type="button" data-territory-filter="{{ t.slug }}">{{ t.title }}</button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="filter-empty-state" data-thinking-empty-state hidden>No articles match this territory yet. <a href="/thinking/" data-thinking-filter-reset>View all →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if featuredArticles.length %}
<section class="tier-dominant">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">Featured</span>
      <h2>Featured Thinking</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for article in featuredArticles %}
      {% set territory = article.data.territory | territoryData %}
      <a class="accent-card{% if territory %} accent-card--{{ territory.accent }}{% endif %}" data-thinking-card{% if territory %} data-territory="{{ territory.slug }}"{% endif %} href="{{ article.url }}">
        {% if territory %}<span class="accent-card__label">{{ territory.title }}</span>{% endif %}
        <h3>{{ article.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ article.data.excerpt }}</p>
        <div class="card-meta" style="margin-top: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0;">{{ article.data.date | readableDate }} · {{ article.templateContent | readingTime }}</div>
        {% set relatedStory = article.data.related_experience | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
        {% if relatedStory %}<p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.5rem;">From the field: {{ relatedStory.data.title }}</p>{% endif %}
        <span class="accent-card__link">Read the article →</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if moreArticles.length %}
<section class="tier-secondary">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">More</span>
      <h2>More Notes</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for article in moreArticles %}
      {% set territory = article.data.territory | territoryData %}
      <a class="article-card" data-thinking-card{% if territory %} data-territory="{{ territory.slug }}"{% endif %} href="{{ article.url }}">
        {% if territory %}<span class="card-category">{{ territory.title }}</span>{% endif %}
        <h3>{{ article.data.title }}</h3>
        <p class="card-body">{{ article.data.excerpt }}</p>
        <div class="card-meta">{{ article.data.date | readableDate }} · {{ article.templateContent | readingTime }}</div>
        <span class="accent-card__link">Read the article →</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if not collections.articles.length %}
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="empty-state">No published articles yet. Add one via Admin → Thinking.</div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="tier-supporting">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "partials/linkedin-cta.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
